OL,3,GNEWSAMan accused of wife's murder faces
OL,4,Atrial
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 80-year-old man accused of murdering
OL,7,Fhis wife at their home has been told
OL,8,Fwhen he could face trial.
OL,10,FParamedics called police to an address
OL,11,Fon Junction Road in Ashford, Surrey
OL,12,Fshortly after 14:00 BST on 22 May
OL,13,Ffollowing the unexpected death of
OL,14,F78-year-old Jill Ellis, police said.
OL,16,FHer husband David Ellis was charged
OL,17,Fwith murder on 30 June.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
