OL,3,GNEWSAMan accused of wife's murder faces
OL,4,Atrial
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuildford Crown Court heard on Thursday
OL,7,Fthat a plea hearing for Ellis was
OL,8,Fscheduled for 2 November with a
OL,9,Fpotential trial due to begin in
OL,10,FJanuary.
